	(text "NOTES DE DISSENY (valors verificats)\nVCC = 12 V. Buck AP1509-50 -> +5V; LDO LMS8117-3.3 -> +3V3 (alimenta la LaunchPad pel pin +3.3V).\nDriver: R_in=33R + 100 pF (tau=3.3 ns); Rg=33R -> t_on~Qg/Io+=325 ns, t_off~186 ns.\nCboot=1 uF X7R: dV=(Qg+Iqbs*t)/C = 0.31 V per 2.4 ms (fase OL mes llarga). Cboot ceramic, no electrolitic.\nShunt 10 mohm 2512: 0.25 W @5 A. Divisor BEMF 39k/3.3k = 0.078 -> 0.94 V @12 V (G=1.1 -> 1.03 V < Vcc-1.5 V LM324/LM339).\nNeutre virtual: 3x10k + 35.7k/3.3k -> 0.0780 (error 0.08 %). Filtre 22 nF, Rth=3.04k -> fc=2.38 kHz (PWM 20 kHz: -18.6 dB).\nRetard ZC: 6 deg @250 Hz, 23 deg @1 kHz electric (compensable al firmware)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 159.766 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a232d58b-8cd0-589a-930e-48377c6d6044")
	)
